# Node modules
**/node_modules

# Build outputs
**/.next
**/out

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Environment variables
**/.env*
**/.env*.local

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# IDE configurations
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.sublime-project
**/*.sublime-workspace

# Git files
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Docker files
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose.yml
**/compose.yml

# Turbo cache (can grow to tens of GB — never ship it to the daemon)
.turbo
**/.turbo

# Test artifacts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/.next-extract

# Local tooling
graphify-out
.claude
apm_modules

# Miscellaneous
**/*.tgz
**/*.zip
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/.sass-cache
**/.cache
**/dist
**/coverage
**/tmp
**/temp

# API uploads
**/uploads

# Native Apple workspace (built on macOS / Xcode, not in Linux Docker containers)
apps/apple

# markdown files
**/README.md

# eslint files
**/eslint.config*

# nodemon files
**/nodemon.*.json

# **Ensure 'public' is NOT ignored**
# If excluding everything, whitelist 'public'
# **
# !public
